Files: packaging/linux/vendor/ppocr-models/*
Copyright: 2020 PaddlePaddle Authors
 2021 RapidOCR Authors
License: Apache-2.0
Comment:
 Vendored PP-OCRv5 mobile detection/recognition/text-line-orientation ONNX
 models plus character dictionary, used unmodified from RapidOCR's official
 ModelScope-hosted ONNX conversion of Baidu's PaddleOCR PP-OCRv5, pinned at
 RapidOCR release tag v3.9.2 — see
 packaging/linux/vendor/ppocr-models/SOURCE.md for exact provenance and
 per-file SHA-256. The model weights and training code are Apache-2.0
 licensed by the PaddlePaddle Authors (github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR);
 the ONNX export/conversion and ModelScope hosting is done by RapidOCR,
 also Apache-2.0 (github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR). Ships in the
 clipnest-ocr-data binary package. Full Apache-2.0 text is Debian's own
 common license at /usr/share/common-licenses/Apache-2.0 — not duplicated
 here, per Debian copyright-format convention for common licenses (lintian
 flags a duplicated copy as copyright-file-contains-full-apache-2-license).

